[b]Main Droid can use various weapons and resources[/b]

- Shoot cannonballs at enemies;
- Install explosive mines and corner opponents;
- Use energy bouncers to destroy nearby robots;
- Push crates and explosive mines;
- Use the turbo and have more speed in the game;
- Use shields to protect yourself from enemy attacks;

Main Droid can pick up various items

- Gold screws that you can collect and buy different weapons;
- Destroy boxes found in the stages and get the items inside them;
- in a certain time, boxes will fall that can help in the battle.

[h3][b]The game contains cool riddles to win prizes[/b][/h3]

